## Ingredients

- 1 cup Cucumber (chopped*)
- 1 cup Tomato (chopped)
- 1/2 cup Red Onions (chopped*)
- 1 Green Chili Pepper (small, optional, chopped*)
- 1 tablespoon Cilantro leaves
- 1/2 teaspoon Roasted Cumin Powder
- 1/4 teaspoon Red Chili powder (Mirchi powder)
- 2 teaspoon Lemon juice
- 1/4 teaspoon Salt

## Method

1. Wash and chop cucumber, onion, tomatoes, green chili pepper into small pieces.
2. In a bowl, add all the chopped veggies, spices, cilantro and mix well.
3. Garnish with cilantro leaves and serve.

